{
    "title": "NFL",
    "description": "Be the ultimate insider with the official app of the NFL --- your one-stop for NFL football. \r\n\r\nGET CLOSER TO THE ACTION:  \r\n- Make the NFL app your central hub for game day and access all available NFL content in one place.  \r\n- Get up-to-the-minute scoring, in-game highlights and drive charts to track every play. \r\n- Go deeper into the game with breaking news, key stories, and insider analysis. \r\n- Stay connected with the NFL Channel and get FREE NFL content 24/7.  \r\n\r\nSTART YOUR GAMEDAY WITH NFL+: \r\n- Watch ad-free highlights from every game. \r\n- Catch NFL Network across devices to watch football news and coverage, plus seven exclusive live games in the 2024 NFL season. \r\n- Stream live local and primetime regular season and postseason games on phone and tablet.  \r\n- Listen to live game audio with home, away and national broadcasts for every game of the season across devices.  \r\n- Get NFL Films\u2019 programming and other on-demand content across devices and ad-free.  \r\n\r\nNFL+ PREMIUM HAS MORE NFL: \r\n- Access everything from NFL+ \r\n- Watch NFL RedZone across devices to catch every touchdown from every game, every Sunday afternoon during the regular season. \r\n- Relive gameday with game replays including full, condensed, and all-22 coaches films across devices, all ad-free.  \r\n- Get access to NFL Pro and over 95 unique player and team performance stats and all-22 film for an advanced analytics platform (available on desktop and mobile web). \r\n\r\nSubscription required for NFL+ and NFL+ Premium. Terms and Conditions Apply to NFL+; visit plus.nfl.com.  \r\n\r\nNFL Network and NFL RedZone are available to stream on an authenticated basis for eligible subscribers of Cox, DirecTV, DISH, Verizon Fios, FuboTV, Hulu + Live TV, Optimum, Sling, Spectrum, Xfinity, YouTubeTV, and more! \r\n\r\nThe NFL app allows use of AirPlay and Chromecast when viewing all video-on-demand and select live content. However, the NFL app does not permit outputs from phones or tablets of live games, NFL RedZone or NFL Network to external displays via HDMI, Chromecast, AirPlay, Miracast or other similar streaming functionality.  \r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.nfl.com/legal/privacy \r\nTerms of Service: www.nfl.com/legal/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Be the ultimate insider with the official app of the NFL --- your one-stop for NFL football. <br><br>GET CLOSER TO THE ACTION:  <br>- Make the NFL app your central hub for game day and access all available NFL content in one place.  <br>- Get up-to-the-minute scoring, in-game highlights and drive charts to track every play. <br>- Go deeper into the game with breaking news, key stories, and insider analysis. <br>- Stay connected with the NFL Channel and get FREE NFL content 24/7.  <br><br>START YOUR GAMEDAY WITH NFL+: <br>- Watch ad-free highlights from every game. <br>- Catch NFL Network across devices to watch football news and coverage, plus seven exclusive live games in the 2024 NFL season. <br>- Stream live local and primetime regular season and postseason games on phone and tablet.  <br>- Listen to live game audio with home, away and national broadcasts for every game of the season across devices.  <br>- Get NFL Films\u2019 programming and other on-demand content across devices and ad-free.  <br><br>NFL+ PREMIUM HAS MORE NFL: <br>- Access everything from NFL+ <br>- Watch NFL RedZone across devices to catch every touchdown from every game, every Sunday afternoon during the regular season. <br>- Relive gameday with game replays including full, condensed, and all-22 coaches films across devices, all ad-free.  <br>- Get access to NFL Pro and over 95 unique player and team performance stats and all-22 film for an advanced analytics platform (available on desktop and mobile web). <br><br>Subscription required for NFL+ and NFL+ Premium. Terms and Conditions Apply to NFL+; visit plus.nfl.com.  <br><br>NFL Network and NFL RedZone are available to stream on an authenticated basis for eligible subscribers of Cox, DirecTV, DISH, Verizon Fios, FuboTV, Hulu + Live TV, Optimum, Sling, Spectrum, Xfinity, YouTubeTV, and more! <br><br>The NFL app allows use of AirPlay and Chromecast when viewing all video-on-demand and select live content. However, the NFL app does not permit outputs from phones or tablets of live games, NFL RedZone or NFL Network to external displays via HDMI, Chromecast, AirPlay, Miracast or other similar streaming functionality.  <br><br>Privacy Policy: https://www.nfl.com/legal/privacy <br>Terms of Service: www.nfl.com/legal/terms",
